was a big part of the small Riverside City's identity. Although it only had 945 students, the college played a significant role in the community. It employed a number of its residents, including physics professor Vigo Rasmussen. Vigo was looking forward to the homecoming game, which he planned to attend with his wife and 7-year-old daughter. But his other daughter, 20-month-old Janice, was too young to join them. About a week before the game, Vigo reached out to the family's regular babysitter to see if she could watch Janice on the night of Saturday, October 24.
是这座小型河滨城市身份的重要组成部分。尽管只有945名学生，但该学院在社区中发挥着重要作用。它雇佣了许多当地居民，包括物理学教授维戈·拉斯穆森（Vigo Rasmussen）。维戈很期待这场返校比赛，他计划和妻子以及7岁的女儿一起参加。但他另一个20个月大的女儿珍妮丝（Janice）太小了，无法和他们一起去。比赛前一周左右，维戈联系了家里的常驻保姆，看她能否在10月24日星期六晚上照看珍妮丝。

9
00:05:32.000 --> 00:06:13.000
She couldn't help as she was going to the game also. Vigo's regular babysitter was the daughter of a colleague, so Vigo again asked around at work to find a replacement. Biology professor Richard Hartley had a studious and kind 15-year-old daughter named Evelyn who came highly recommended. When Vigo asked if she would be able to watch Janice in a week's time, Evelyn agreed. Evelyn soon began to have second thoughts. She had a bad feeling about the job, plus she wasn't keen on staying in while everyone
她帮不上忙，因为她也要去看比赛。维戈的常驻保姆是他一位同事的女儿，所以维戈又在工作中四处打听寻找替代人选。生物学教授理查德·哈特利有一个勤奋善良的15岁女儿，名叫伊芙琳，她受到了高度推荐。当维戈问她一周后是否能照看珍妮丝时，伊芙琳同意了。伊芙琳很快开始有了顾虑。她对这份工作有一种不好的预感，而且她也不想在每个人都在返校比赛中玩得开心时待在家里。

10
00:06:13.000 --> 00:06:50.000
else was having fun at the homecoming game. Evelyn wondered aloud if she could back out of the agreement. Her mother Ethel reminded her that she'd made a commitment to the Rasmussen's and should do the right thing by sticking to it. When Saturday night arrived, Evelyn packed several textbooks so she could study while Janice slept and waited for Vigo Rasmussen to collect her as planned. Before leaving she promised to call her parents at 8.30 to check in as she always did when she babysat.
伊芙琳大声问自己是否可以退出这个约定。她的母亲埃塞尔提醒她，她已经对拉斯穆森一家做出了承诺，应该信守承诺，做正确的事。周六晚上到来时，伊芙琳带了几本教科书，这样她可以在珍妮丝睡觉时学习，并等待维戈·拉斯穆森按计划来接她。离开前，她答应像往常做保姆时那样，在8点30分给父母打电话报平安。

11
00:06:50.000 --> 00:07:34.000
Vigo Rasmussen picked Evelyn up at 6.30pm and drove her back to his family's house. Evelyn set up her textbooks in the living room and Madeline Rasmussen, Vigo's wife, gave her instructions. It was going to be a straightforward night. Janice was to go to bed at 7 o'clock and then all Evelyn would have to do was check in on her at 7.15 and cover her with a blanket. At 6.45pm the Rasmussen said goodbye to Evelyn and headed to watch the game. Two and a half hours later, Richard Hartley stood in the basement of the Rasmussen home.
维戈·拉斯穆森在下午6点30分接上伊芙琳，开车把她送回了家。伊芙琳在客厅里摆好教科书，维戈的妻子玛德琳·拉斯穆森（Madeline Rasmussen）给了她一些指示。这将是一个简单的夜晚。珍妮丝要在7点钟上床睡觉，然后伊芙琳所要做的就是7点15分去看看她，并给她盖上毯子。下午6点45分，拉斯穆森夫妇和伊芙琳道别，前往观看比赛。两个半小时后，理查德·哈特利站在了拉斯穆森家的地下室里。

12
00:07:34.000 --> 00:08:10.000
He'd let himself in through an open window to find out why his daughter wasn't answering the home's phone or door. Having come across one of Evelyn's shoes at the base of the stairs, Richard raced up to the main part of the house. Evelyn's schoolbooks were scattered across the living room. Her brand new eyeglasses were lying on the floor, as was her other black shoe. Smeared across the light-colored rug was a muddy shoe print. There were also several drops of blood.
他通过一扇开着的窗户钻了进来，想弄清楚为什么女儿不接家里的电话也不开门。在楼梯底部发现伊芙琳的一只鞋后，理查德冲向房子的主区域。伊芙琳的课本散落在客厅里。她崭新的眼镜掉在地板上，另一只黑鞋也是。浅色的地毯上涂抹着一个泥泞的鞋印。还有几滴血迹。

13
00:08:10.000 --> 00:08:48.000
Richard checked the rest of the house. Janice was unharmed and fast asleep in her crib. But Evelyn was nowhere to be found. Local police were preparing to go home after a quiet night when a call came through at 9.49pm about a missing teenage girl. They weren't overly concerned, believing the girl had likely gone to see a boy and would be found within 10 minutes. Two officers arrived at the Rasmussen residence, where Richard Hartley was waiting to meet them.
理查德检查了房子的其余部分。珍妮丝安然无恙，在婴儿床上睡得很熟。但伊芙琳却不见踪影。当地警方在平静的夜晚准备下班时，在晚上9点49分接到了一个关于一名少女失踪的电话。他们并没有太担心，认为女孩很可能是去见男朋友了，10分钟内就会被找到。两名警官抵达拉斯穆森住所，理查德·哈特利正在那里等候他们。

14
00:08:48.000 --> 00:09:28.000
The officers soon realized how serious the situation was. Over a dozen more officers arrived, along with detectives, the district attorney, and the La Crosse County Sheriff. The Rasmissons had moved into the house just a few months earlier. The ordinary ranch-style suburban home had three bedrooms. It was part of a new subdivision, and like many other residences in the neighborhood, it was so new that its windows had no blinds or curtains. It sat close to other houses on the street, and there were enough people around that it
警官们很快意识到情况的严重性。十几名警官赶到现场，还有侦探、地方检察官和拉克罗斯县警长。拉斯穆森一家几个月前才搬进这所房子。这栋普通的牧场式郊区住宅有三间卧室。它是新开发区的一部分，和邻里的许多其他住宅一样，它太新了，窗户上没有百叶窗或窗帘。它靠近街上的其他房子，周围有足够多的人，即使在这样一个安静的夜晚，

15
00:09:28.000 --> 00:10:06.000
didn't feel isolated or remote, even on a quiet night like this. Outside, investigators noticed someone had used a screwdriver to try and pry open three separate windows. A flower bed below one window featured an imprint of a size 11 tennis shoe, matching the muddy shoe print on the living room rug. After failing to jimmy the other windows open, the intruder finally succeeded with the basement window. Several red fibers on its surface matched the jeans Evelyn Hartley had been wearing that
它也不显得孤立或偏远。在外面，调查人员注意到有人曾用螺丝刀试图撬开三扇不同的窗户。其中一扇窗户下的花坛里有一个11码网球鞋的印记，与客厅地毯上的泥泞鞋印相符。在未能撬开其他窗户后，入侵者最终成功打开了地下室的窗户。窗户表面上的几根红色纤维与伊芙琳·哈特利那天晚上穿的牛仔裤相符。

16
00:10:06.000 --> 00:10:45.000
evening. Whoever had broken into the basement had forced the 15-year-old out via the same route. While it was initially thought the intruder had placed the step ladder under the basement window to secure their escape, the Rasmussen's revealed that they had propped the ladder there on a previous occasion. The fact it sat in such an opportune location for the abductor was merely a coincidence. Traces of blood were found inside the basement, with more just outside about 10 feet from the window.
无论谁闯入了地下室，都通过同样的路线强行带走了这名15岁的女孩。虽然最初认为入侵者是将梯子放在地下室窗户下以确保逃脱，但拉斯穆森一家透露，他们之前曾把梯子靠在那里。它处于对绑架者如此有利的位置纯属巧合。地下室里发现了血迹，窗外约10英尺处也有更多血迹。

17
00:10:45.000 --> 00:11:29.000
A large pool of blood on the ground nearby was consistent with a severely injured person having laid down there to recover. A bloody handprint was smeared across the outside wall of the Rasmussen house. Another was found on the exterior of a neighbor's garage about 100 yards away. Pools of blood lined an external wall of a third house just around the corner. The blood was Type A, the same as Evelyn's. Bloodhounds tracked the scent for two blocks but then stopped. It seemed Evelyn had been forced into a vehicle there and whisked away.
附近地上的一大滩血迹与一个受重伤的人躺在那里恢复体力的情况相符。拉斯穆森家外墙上涂抹着一个血手印。大约100码外的一位邻居的车库外也发现了一个。拐角处第三栋房子的外墙边有一滩血迹。血型是A型，和伊芙琳的一样。警犬追踪气味走了两个街区，但随后停了下来。看来伊芙琳在那里被强行塞进了一辆车，然后被带走了。

18
00:11:29.000 --> 00:12:13.000
An alert was issued and descriptions of Evelyn Hartley were sent out. At foot 7, 126 pounds, straight brown hair and blue eyes, last seen wearing red jeans rolled up at the cuff, bobby socks and a white blouse. Janice Rasmussen was in her crib but was not covered in a blanket. This led investigators to assume that Evelyn was confronted within the 15 minute window between Janice's bed time at 7 and 7.15 when Evelyn was supposed to cover Janice with a blanket. Evelyn's attacker likely gave her a bloody nose which had caused the initial blood spots
警方发布了警报，并发送了伊芙琳·哈特利的描述。身高5英尺7英寸（约1.7米），体重126磅（约57公斤），直棕发，蓝眼睛，最后一次露面时穿着卷边的红色牛仔裤、短袜和白色衬衫。珍妮丝·拉斯穆森在婴儿床上，但没有盖毯子。这导致调查人员推测，伊芙琳是在珍妮丝7点睡觉到7点15分伊芙琳本应给她盖毯子之间的15分钟窗口期内遭遇袭击的。伊芙琳的袭击者很可能让她流了鼻血，这导致了客厅地毯上最初的血点。

19
00:12:13.000 --> 00:12:48.000
on the living room rug. Once outside the basement, the attacker had hit Evelyn with the window screen causing a greater injury. Evelyn had lost significant amounts of blood as her abductor forced her away from the Rasmussen home. She stopped periodically causing her blood to pool in certain areas. The bloody handprints were from Evelyn dragging her hand along the buildings they passed. When Richard Hartley saw the blood the next morning in the harsh light of day, he feared
一旦到了地下室外，袭击者就用窗纱击打了伊芙琳，造成了更严重的伤害。当绑架者强行将伊芙琳带离拉斯穆森家时，她流失了大量的血。她不时停下来，导致她的血在某些区域汇集。血手印是伊芙琳在经过建筑物时拖着手留下的。当理查德·哈特利第二天早上在刺眼的日光下看到血迹时，他担心

